@{ ViewData["Title"] = "About us"; }
<section class="auth-shell"><article class="auth-card profile-card content-page">
    <span class="eyebrow">About BudgetBasics</span>
    <h1>Money skills made approachable.</h1>
    <p>BudgetBasics is a student-focused educational project that turns budgeting, saving, needs and wants, and everyday spending decisions into short lessons and practical exercises.</p>
    <h2>What the project offers</h2>
    <p>Visitors can learn core concepts, calculate a sample 50-30-20 split, estimate a savings goal, explore visual resources, practise expense planning, and ask the local BudgetBee assistant.</p>
    <h2>What it does not do</h2>
    <p>BudgetBasics is not a bank and does not perform transactions. Its examples and calculations are educational and are not professional financial advice.</p>
    <h2>Who created it</h2>
    <p>BudgetBasics was designed and developed by the <strong>BudgetBasics Student Development Team</strong> for the Web Innovation Unleashed educational project. The project focuses on clear explanations, accessible interaction, privacy-conscious practice tools, and responsible financial learning.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" asp-action="Index">Explore BudgetBasics</a>
</article></section>
